# Keeper's Light's sea cave (CIPlay keepers_light_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: kit_uw mouth on the sea floor at 68 46 (pad -5; yaw 270: way in = -x), tunnel 29.1 m up 15 degrees (+7.5 m), the
# den beyond (middle ~29 46) under a new stack off the light's shore; air zone kl_seacave there, the chest klseacavechest.
# Heights are guesses: the pad -5, the den floor ~+2.5.
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Keeper's Light keep
offset 1.5612 -3.4453
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture kl_seacave_out 93 6 46 29 3 46
# From the sea outside the mouth, down to it and up the tunnel (15 degrees, 4 pieces) into the dry den
at 76 46 h=-2
swim 76 46 -3.5 to 68 46 -3.5 to 59 46 -1.5 to 49 46 1 to 40 46 3.2 to 29 46 3.5
air kl_seacave here
picture kl_seacave_in 38 4 46 29 3 46 light=20
open Keepers' cache
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 1
swim 29 46 3.5 to 40 46 3.2 to 49 46 1 to 59 46 -1.5 to 68 46 -3.5 to 76 46 -2
